audio: shuffle music/Hari_Merdeka.wav

= The Revolution of August 1945

On Friday, 17 August, Year 1945, there is happened a proclamation. The proclamation which stated Indonesia's independent and that matters concerning the 'transfer of power' and 'other' matters will be executed in an 'orderly' manner and in the 'shortest' possible time.

Anyway the news of it spreads quick and abroad yet most of the people don't believe it nor the International community, thus the road towards actual liberation and recognition is still long.

It seems that for now, anything is possible. The Japanese force has been *diminished*. A new order is ready to be built.

