= Leftover from the Japanese smth

The Empire of Japan maybe has stopped continue the War yet this is as far as we know are a truce, with the chances of eventual peace treaty will be done by next month. Its armed force and civilians are still here, some are following the truce while others are uncertain.

May they not do something sus.

